  "draftChanges": [
    "First-stage multi-passenger roster with stable scan ownership",
    "Named missing-detail dialogs and per-passenger OCR confirmations",
    "Idempotent simulated customer records with guardian-managed minors",
    "Recorded reimbursement branch with source questions and receipt/event uploads",
    "Never-recovered baggage hides inapplicable days question; resolved errors clear",
    "Direct typed birth dates preserve ISO values and original minor checks",
    "Restored airline, airport and flight-number lookup controls",
    "OCR-first intake wrapper",
    "Flight details include editable booking reference and ticket number",
    "Seven-stage navigation including scan and OCR confirmation",
    "Two equal upload cards with aligned icon/title/status rows",
    "Shared light surfaces (#F8FAFF) and consistent fields (#FCFDFF)",
    "Editable post-upload OCR review with explicit confirmation before POA",
    "Passenger reminder before POA",
    "New passenger action exists only on the document upload screen; next claim page has no add action",
    "Back navigation throughout the claim preserves inputs and updates the existing claim",
    "Baggage loss skips duration and offers a missing PIR after verification",
    "After verification, ask only for missing baggage-loss PIR or reimbursement receipts",
    "Flight delay choices: 3–5 hours, 5–8 hours, over 8 hours",
    "Receipts-only reimbursement stage with OCR confirmation, rescans and original-currency checkout totals",
    "Named booking passengers are linked to stable roster IDs and saved with the booking fallback",
    "Flight and passenger confirmations use Yes/No radio choices with incomplete-state notes",
    "Primary POA view removes copy, manual status-check and resend actions; in-page EasyDo embedding requires vendor approval",
    "Second motivational note after confirmation; saved corrections retained",
    "Confirmation load/save guards and locked future stages",
    "Compact centered homepage intro",
    "Encouragement after successful document uploads and forward navigation",
    "Preview-only XHR upload adapter using existing in-memory API fixtures",
    "Localized reimbursement tutorial placeholder in both Help Centers; no coming-soon label or fake playback"
  ],
